---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Novedades IA | TAP-IA">
    <Header />

    <section class="pt-36 pb-12 px-6 relative border-b border-white/5 bg-charcoal">
        <div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-gold/15 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-6">
            <div>
                <span class="text-gold text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 inline-block">Weekly Update</span>
                <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl text-white mb-4">Novedades IA</h1>
                <p class="text-subtle text-lg max-w-2xl">Noticias de Inteligencia Artificial filtradas exclusivamente por su impacto real en marketing y negocios.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden md:flex gap-3">
                <div class="relative">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar noticia o herramienta..." class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white rounded-full py-2 pl-4 pr-10 focus:outline-none focus:border-gold/50 w-64 text-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-subtle text-xs"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CATEGORÍAS & FILTROS -->
    <section class="py-6 px-6 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01]">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="sr-only">Categorías</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
                <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-gold text-charcoal font-medium rounded-full">Top Semanal</a>
                <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 text-subtle hover:text-white rounded-full transition-colors">Modelos</a>
                <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 text-subtle hover:text-white rounded-full transition-colors">Herramientas</a>
                <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 text-subtle hover:text-white rounded-full transition-colors">Agentes</a>
                <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 text-subtle hover:text-white rounded-full transition-colors">IA en Marketing</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TOP SEMANAL NEWS -->
    <section class="py-16 px-6 min-h-[50vh]">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl mb-10 text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-gold mr-3"></i>Lo más relevante de la semana</h2>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <!-- FEATURED POST -->
                <article class="matte-card p-8 rounded-2xl group border-l-4 border-l-gold block relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(212,175,55,0.1)]">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
                        <div class="flex-grow">
                            <div class="flex gap-3 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                                <span class="text-gold">Modelos</span>
                                <span class="text-subtle/50">•</span>
                                <span class="text-subtle">Hoy</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl text-white font-serif mb-3 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors">
                                <a href="/novedades-ia/noticia-mock">Google lanza actualización masiva en su algoritmo de IA generativa</a>
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-subtle mb-6 line-clamp-2">Una nueva actualización mayor promete cambiar por completo cómo Google interpreta las búsquedas B2B. ¿Qué significa esto para tu blog de empresa?</p>
                            
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between mt-auto">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-subtle">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cube"></i> Fuente: <strong>Google/DeepMind</strong>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/novedades-ia/noticia-mock" class="text-white text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Leer Análisis <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-gold"></i></a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- POST 2 -->
                <article class="matte-card p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl group transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-medium text-subtle/80 md:pt-1">
                            Mar 2, 2026
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-grow">
                            <span class="text-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Herramientas</span>
                            <h3 class="text-xl text-white font-medium mb-2 group-hover:text-gold transition-colors">
                                <a href="/novedades-ia/noticia-mock">Nueva función de agentes en HubSpot (Beta cerrada)</a>
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-subtle mb-4">Guía rápida de cómo prepararse para activar la atención 24/7 y la precalificación de leads calientes nativa en el CRM.</p>
                            <div class="text-xs text-subtle/60 uppercase">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cube mr-1"></i> Fuente: HubSpot
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- POST 3 -->
                <article class="matte-card p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl group transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-32 flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-medium text-subtle/80 md:pt-1">
                            Feb 28, 2026
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-grow">
                            <span class="text-emerald-500 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">IA en Marketing</span>
                            <h3 class="text-xl text-white font-medium mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors">
                                <a href="/novedades-ia/noticia-mock">ChatGPT Search superando el 15% de adopción en escritorio B2B</a>
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-subtle mb-4">La estrategia SEO clásica ya no es suficiente. Por qué las empresas en 2026 deben apostar a GEO en un entorno altamente competitivo.</p>
                            <div class="text-xs text-subtle/60 uppercase">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cube mr-1"></i> Fuente: OpenAI
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
                
                <div class="text-center pt-8">
                    <button class="px-6 py-2 border border-white/10 text-subtle hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
                        Cargar más actualizaciones
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOURCES -->
    <section class="py-12 border-t border-white/5 bg-charcoal">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-subtle mb-6 font-semibold">Fuentes Monitorizadas (ES/EN)</h2>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 opacity-40">
                <span class="font-medium">OpenAI</span>
                <span class="font-medium">Google/DeepMind</span>
                <span class="font-medium">Anthropic</span>
                <span class="font-medium">Meta AI</span>
                <span class="font-medium">Microsoft AI</span>
                <span class="font-medium">Perplexity</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
</Layout>
